## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-Live-1 (Astra, medium)
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s full-duplex speech-to-speech model with GPT-6 Astra (medium) as delegated reasoning backend, designed for tool-heavy spoken customer support (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI realtime/live voice stack (per metadata). Local metadata lists `openai/gpt-live-1-astra`, session pricing $0.05/min, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `gpt-live-1-astra`, `openai/gpt-live-1-astra`.
- **Context window:** 128K tokens per Live session (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Audio and text input; audio and text output (image/video unsupported per metadata); tool calls and delegated reasoning.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.05 per minute of voice session ($3.00/hour), billed per second; backend model and tools billed separately.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary speech-to-speech voice layer with delegated backend reasoning model. Architecture details not publicly disclosed.

